      "text": [
        ": سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنِ اَلْمُسْتَحَاضَةِ قَالَ «تَصُومُ شَهْرَ رَمَضَانَ إِلاَّ اَلْأَيَّامَ اَلَّتِي كَانَتْ تَحِيضُ فِيهِنَّ ثُمَّ تَقْضِيهَا مِنْ بَعْدِهِ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1990 - It was narrated from Sama'ah:\n\"I asked Abu Abdullah (as) about the woman experiencing istihadha (irregular bleeding).\nImam (as) said: 'She fasts during the Month of Ramadan, except for the days on which she would normally have her menstrual period. She must then make up those days afterward.'\""
        ]
      }
